---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="About the Digivated Project Directory" description="Discover independent projects, meet their makers, and share your work on Digivated.">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT DIGIVATED</p><h1>About Digivated</h1><p class="lede">Digivated is a directory and launch community for independent software, tools, and side projects. Builders can submit projects, and visitors can discover, upvote, and leave feedback on listings.</p></header>
  <figure class="ascii-brand-art"><img src="/digivated-ascii-art.png" alt="Digivated ASCII artwork, a builder at work" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></figure>
  <div class="about-copy">
    <div class="about-values">
      <div><h2>Discover a project.</h2><p>Browse the <a href="/discover">indie project directory</a> to find projects and meet their makers.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Help good work stand out.</h2><p>Leave feedback on project listings, upvote projects you like, and see how they rank on the <a href="/rankings">community leaderboard</a>.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Find your next resource.</h2><p>Browse useful sites by category, or keep interesting projects in your private browser collections.</p></div>
      <div><h2>Share what you’re building.</h2><p>Create a free account to submit a project and follow its review. Submission status and review-team feedback stay in your account.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p>Submit for free or pay $5 to publish right away. We review projects before featuring them.</p>
    <p><a href="/membership">Digivated Membership</a> costs $5 USD once and includes one reviewed project spotlight and full member News summaries. Previous purchases and free toolkit samples remain available.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/discover">Explore projects</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project">Submit a project</a></div>
  </div>
</Platform>
